{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27359","headline":"留别薛仆射 · 平曾","name":"留别薛仆射","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"梯山航海几崎岖，来谒金陵薜大夫。\n毛发竖时趋剑戟，衣冠俨处拜冰壶。\n诚知两轴非珠玉，深愧三缣恤旅途。\n明日过江风景好，不堪回首望勾吴。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"平曾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27359.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27359","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}